{"id":"607638","name":"葱油大虾焖面","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/607638/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大虾","amount":"4个"},{"name":"鲜面条","amount":"60g"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"一棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"野生对虾，差不多6～8个一斤。","img":"images/607638/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾处理干净，大葱切段。","img":"images/607638/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"买的网红的电热不粘锅，烧热放食用油。","img":"images/607638/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放大葱炒香。","img":"images/607638/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/607638/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒均匀放大虾。","img":"images/607638/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒。","img":"images/607638/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒至大虾变色放清水。","img":"images/607638/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取鲜面条。","img":"images/607638/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面条放大虾上。","img":"images/607638/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖锅盖把面条焖煮。","img":"images/607638/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"面条煮熟即可。","img":"images/607638/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/607638/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"大虾很鲜美，放了生抽就不需要放别的调味品。如果面多的话，可以酌情加食盐。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}